IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/Community-Coworking-Day-the-Ion-5.png?ver=17846446
 29
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Community-Coworking-Day-the-Ion-5.png?ver=1784644629
UID:M97fCRZnHoLnrGz1eR5n3
SUMMARY:Industrious Coworking Day: Summer Series
DTSTAMP:20260824T034001Z
DTSTART:20260827T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/c1h8xq1m \n​Summer Co-Working D
	ay at Industrious \n​Join us at Industrious on August 27th from 8:00 AM – 
	5:00 PM for a full day of productivity\, connection\, and community. Exper
	ience what it’s like to work from our vibrant workspace with complimentary
	 coworking for the day\, high-speed WiFi\, and opportunities to meet other
	 professionals in the building. \n​We’ll kick off the morning with breakfa
	st\, followed by specialty snacks from a featured caterer\, and plenty of 
	opportunities for networking throughout the day. Our team will also be off
	ering guided tours of the space and sharing upcoming programming and event
	s happening in the community. \n​To wrap up the day\, join us for a happy 
	hour from 4:00 – 5:00 PM — drinks are on us as we continue the conversatio
	n and celebrate the Industrious community. \n​What to expect: \n​Complimen
	tary coworking from 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM \n​Breakfast to start your day \n​Sp
	ecialty snacks from a guest caterer \n​Networking opportunities with membe
	rs and guests \n​Free high-speed WiFi \n​Workspace tours and insights into
	 upcoming programming \n​Happy Hour (4:00 – 5:00 PM) — drinks on us \n​Par
	king:\nParking is free for the first 3 hours\, then $10 for the remainder 
	of the day. \n​Come work\, connect\, and experience a day in the life at I
	ndustrious. We look forward to welcoming you!\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/e
	vent/industrious-coworking-day-summer-series-2/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/industrious-coworking-day-summer-series-2
	/
LOCATION:Industrious\, 4201 Main St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT9H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-
 content/uploads/2026/07/Ion-Website-Design_1080x830.png?ver=1785449581
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://iondistrict.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07
 /Ion-Website-Design_1080x830.png?ver=1785449581
UID:LHbeq5ZBm7TIglY0z4fOK
SUMMARY:Illuminate: The Official Launch Experience
DTSTAMP:20260824T034001Z
DTSTART:20260827T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/LaunchExperience \n​Illuminate 
	is the official public launch experience for Lumino. Join founders\, merch
	ants\, creators\, investors\, and community leaders for a full day of keyn
	otes\, industry breakout sessions\, and networking as we unveil the Lumino
	 ecosystem and the future of Local Conscious Commerce. \n​The day moves th
	rough three keynote acts — Past\, Present\, and Future — tracing Lumino’s 
	founding story\, what’s live today\, and where the platform is headed. Fro
	m there\, guests choose an industry-specific breakout session\, hear from 
	a lineup of champion speakers\, and close the day at a happy hour with our
	 first-floor restaurant partners. \n​Agenda \n​8:30 AM Guest arrival \n​9:
	00–10:00 AM Past — Lumino State of the Union \n​10:00–11:00 AM Present — T
	he Lumino Launch Keynote \n​11:00 AM–11:30 AM Future — The Future of Lumin
	o & Global Conscious Commerce \n​11:30–12:30 PM Lunch\, served in Lower Lo
	bby \n​12:30–1:30 PM Breakout sessions: Non-Profit\, Hospitality\, Online 
	Coaching\, Startup\, Payment Processing \n​2:00–2:30 PM Eric Rock – Missio
	n Project \n​2:30— 3:00 PM Champion Keynote (Coming Soon) \n​3:00–4:00 PM 
	Micro keynotes (15 min each) \n​4:00–6:00 PM Happy hour — 1st floor restau
